/// GD32VW553 BLE — thin Klin surface over `ble_sdk.c`.
/// Engine = GigaDevice VW55x BLE SDK (`ble_init` / `app_adv_*` / `ble_gatts_*` /
/// `ble_scan_*` / `ble_conn_*` / `ble_gattc_*`, AN152). Not part of `machine_gd32v`.
/// Not `esp_ble` (ESP-IDF NimBLE).
///
/// GATT MVP (`@v0.2.0`): default service `0xFFF0`, char `0xFFF1`
/// (read / write / notify), value buffer max 20 bytes.
/// Central (`@v0.3.0`): active scan (max 16, dedupe by addr) + connect by index.
/// GATT client (`@v0.4.0`): discover/read/write/subscribe for active UUID.
/// Bonding (`@v0.5.0`): Just Works pair + SDK flash store (`bond_enable` / `bond_start`).
/// Custom UUID16 (`@v0.6.0`): `gatt_uuid16` before `init` (default remains 0xFFF0/0xFFF1).
/// Passkey (`@v0.7.0`): `bond_passkey(pin)` MITM + fixed PIN (replaces Just Works SM).
/// UUID128 + multi (`@v0.8.0`): `gatt_uuid128` / `gatt_add_*` / `gatt_*_at` / `gattc_select`.
/// Privacy (`@v0.9.0`): LE privacy / RPA via `privacy_enable` before advertise/scan/connect.
/// Mesh (`@v0.10.0`): Gen OnOff node via `mesh_enable` (needs SDK mesh / BLE_MAX like light_demo).
/// Mesh provisioner (`@v0.11.0`): `mesh_provisioner_enable` + unprov table + `mesh_prov_adv`/`gatt`.
/// Mesh Level + vendor (`@v0.12.0`): `mesh_level*` + `mesh_vnd*` on the Gen OnOff node composition.
/// Mesh Friend/LPN (`@v0.13.0`): `mesh_lpn_*` / `mesh_friend_*` (needs SDK LOW_POWER / FRIEND).
/// Mesh interactive OOB (`@v0.14.0`): `mesh_oob_auth_*` / `mesh_prov_*_begin` + poll.
/// Central / GATT client / bonding need an SDK build with those roles (e.g. msdk_ffd).
module gd32v_ble

